  "decision": "Not fitted or scored for CAD/artery prediction. All 82 participants belong to a CABG-selected CAD cohort, no matched negative CAD group or named coronary stenosis outcomes are supplied. Follow-up echo observations are post-treatment repeated visits, not pre-test training inputs. This may support a separate participant-grouped waveform study, with no current clinical accuracy claim. Raw tables and identifiers remain local."
